1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,150
(Penny:)How long
has this been going on?
Four months.

2
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:04,290
(Sheldon:)She's not my girlfriend.
Are you telling me, for
the past four months

3
00:00:04,290 --> 00:00:05,740
(Penny:)I have been asking you,
"What's new?"

4
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:07,320
(Penny:)and you never thought
to go with,

5
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:08,540
"Sheldon has a girlfriend"?

6
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:10,440
She's not my girlfriend.

7
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:11,530
Ah... d-d-d-d...

8
00:00:11,530 --> 00:00:13,240
(Penny:)How did they meet?

9
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:15,460
(Howard:)Raj and I entered Sheldon's
information on a dating site,

10
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:17,870
(Howard:)and it spit out
Amy Farrah Fowler.

11
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:20,170
(Penny:)Oh, my God!
Sheldon and Amy.

12
00:00:20,170 --> 00:00:22,000
(Howard:)Or, as we
call them, "Shamy."

13
00:00:23,810 --> 00:00:24,970
(Howard:)Shamy.

14
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:27,230
(Penny(squeals):)I am so digging the Shamy.

15
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:29,640
(Penny:)All right,
everyone pay attention.

16
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:31,810
(Sheldon:)Yes, I have a friend
named Amy Farrah Fowler.

17
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:33,380
(Sheldon:)Yes, she is female.

18
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:35,820
(Sheldon:)Yes, we communicate
on a daily basis,

19
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:38,240
(Sheldon:)but no, she is not
my girlfriend.

20
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:40,720
(Penny:)Okay, well, what do
you communicate about?

21
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:44,780
(Sheldon:)Well, my work in physics,
her work in neurobiology,

22
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:46,490
(Sheldon:)and most recently,
the possibility

23
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:49,030
(Sheldon:)of our having a child together.

24
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:59,020
(Penny(spits out drink explosively. Howard types. Robot arm hands Penny a napkin):)Thank you.

